WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.294
♪♪

00:00:02.294 --> 00:00:04.296
Lin:
It started with a simple choice,

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.840
Lin:
escape or die.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.175
♪♪

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.261
Lin:
In that moment, I didn’t dare
think I might be free.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.056
♪♪

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:16.308
I was introduced to this novel,

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:17.476
Charlie Hunnam:
Shantaram,

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:19.311
Charlie Hunnam:
and just fell madly in love with
it,

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:19.978
♪♪

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:24.483
Charlie Hunnam:
and I wanted to come back to TV
because of this series.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.693
Lin:
Every day on the run is your
whole life.

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:29.613
Lin:
There’s hope and excitement in
the new.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.115
♪♪

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:34.368
Sujaya Dasgupta:
Shantaram means “Man of God’s
peace,”

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:38.497
and it reflects the man that Lin
wants to be.

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:42.459
Lin’s past life is driving him
on this journey for redemption.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.503
Karla:
You can be free of anything but
yourself.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.838
You don’t know anything about
me.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.590
I thought there was something
worth knowing.

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:51.510
It’s about the discovery of
one’s self 

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.846
Antonia Desplat:
merged with the vibrant world
that is India.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:56.932
Karla:
I don’t want to know your
secrets, Lin.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.685
In Bombay everyone’s story is
their own to keep.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:01.937
He goes on a wonderful journey,

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.105
Charlie Hunnam:
finds a lot of friends.

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:04.898
Prabhu:
You are in need of assistance? 

00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:06.191
Prabhu:
I can show you everything.

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:08.568
Okay, you win.

00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:11.947
Charlie Hunnam:
If you don’t trust people,
you’re never going to survive

00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:13.365
what India demands of you.

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.535
Come home, with me.

00:01:16.952 --> 00:01:19.579
Prabhu is leading Lin to
salvation.

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:22.040
Prabhu:
Here, everyone’s helping each
other.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.959
♪♪

00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:25.627
Lin:
Back home, I drove an ambulance.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.629
I could do more with better
supplies.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:30.382
Khader Khan:
I’ve heard you are the foreign
doctor.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.259
I wonder what compels you.

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:36.805
There are times when you need to
go to the dark side in order
to reach salvation.

00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:39.683
Fate saw fit to throw us
together.

00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:44.730
That pure drive to be good,
that is what allows

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.940
the underworld bosses to
manipulate Lin.

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:48.984
♪♪

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:49.943
What do you want with him?

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:53.071
Khader Khan:
I just see someone who needs
help to find their path.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.991
So often, in trying to do the
right thing

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:57.993
in this world he doesn’t really
understand,

00:01:58.201 --> 00:01:59.494
Steve Lightfoot:
he ends up doing the wrong
thing

00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:01.830
Steve Lightfoot:
and now he’s got something else
he has to make up for.

00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:03.498
There are no good men or bad
men,

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:04.791
Khader Khan:
it is what they do

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:07.002
Khader Khan:
that makes them good or evil.

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:10.547
Karla:
For a man who doesn’t want
trouble you keep interesting company.

00:02:10.714 --> 00:02:11.715
Does that include you?

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:14.176
Steve Lightfoot:
As big and huge as the story
gets,

00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:16.511
Steve Lightfoot:
it’s fundamentally about a man
who’s just trying to be able

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:18.764
to look himself in the mirror and
like what he sees.

00:02:18.847 --> 00:02:20.515
♪♪

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:21.850
Lin:
I want to be the man I was gonna
be,

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:23.602
before all of this.

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:27.064
♪♪

